WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — agency (30s) Narrator Joy

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.065
What separates a goal-holding agent from a script? It

2
00:00:04.065 --> 00:00:07.654
must finish a job inside a physical energy budget.

3
00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:12.803
Act too slowly and static baseline power drains your battery.

4
00:00:12.803 --> 00:00:16.523
Act too frantically and switching drag explodes.

5
00:00:16.943 --> 00:00:20.834
Between those two traps sits an exact optimal tempo

6
00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:25.259
where useful progress per joule reaches its physical peak.

7
00:00:25.679 --> 00:00:32.559
Correctness is the gate, and joules order every system that passes it across pre-registered runs.
